domain StageRc18EffortLoss:
  description "Failed paid Stage trial and bounded perception transfer analysis"
problem P1:
  "Stage rc18 must finish without losing required action-effort self perception."
evidence E1:
  |
    Run37901860044 failed at exact staged revision battle execution. Its job emitted
    BATTLE_FINISHED. Read-only DB inspection of btl_111779337b677728cd3a14aede6a84f5
    shows canonical and runtime incomplete, reason AWARENESS_EFFORT_PERCEPTION_REQUIRED,
    both sides with battle-action-effort-v1 policy, both frames without actionEffort.
    Its recorded turn0 includes a physical utterance. All six ledger attempts completed;
    reported total31214 tokens, outstanding0. No paid retry was executed.
evidence E2:
  |
    battle-service prologue invokes commitAwarenessExpressions. That function rebuilds
    both perception frames when a physical utterance exists, calls projectObserverPerception
    without actionEffort. perception-projection constructs a new frame and includes
    actionEffort only from its explicit input, without fallback to previousFrame.
    awareness-context rejects a policy-bearing combatant whose frame omits actionEffort
    with the exact persisted reason. These are observations of unchanged rc18 source.
evidence E3:
  |
    advanceTurnWithLease catches a required boundary failure and persists incomplete.
    Core advance rejects any nonactive state as BATTLE_FINISHED. The E2E loop continues
    while public status differs from finished. Thus its next advance obscures the saved
    failure reason. This error does not prove normal completion.
evidence E4:
  |
    Provider responses completed and the durable explicit reason identifies a missing
    observer field rather than a timeout or token ceiling. Exact historical introduction,
    full regression reproduction, and whether other frame-rebuild paths also lose fields
    remain unverified. Existing expression tests assert speech delivery, not effort retention.
decision D1 based_on P1, E1, E2, E3, E4:
  |
    The current changeable producing condition is the utterance frame rebuild omitting
    explicit action-effort projection: it constructs replacement observer frames without
    the mandatory self information. A physical utterance triggers this path; subsequent
    context validation stops the battle. BATTLE_FINISHED is a diagnostic masking condition,
    not its original producing cause. Source and durable record support this bounded chain;
    dynamic isolated reproduction remains required before declaring correction.
decision D2 based_on D1, E4:
  |
    Prepare a typed projection repair with a regression that sends the resulting frame
    into awareness context for both sides. Separately improve incomplete-state diagnostics.
    Do not weaken required information checks, accept incomplete as finished, rerun paid
    Stage under the exhausted one-run authorization, or promote the failed candidate.
